{"ref":"BDB, שְׁמַרְיָ֫ה(וּ)","hw":"שְׁמַרְיָ֫ה(וּ)","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁמַרְיָ֫ה(וּ)</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>has kept, preserved</em><strong>)</strong>;—Σαμαρ(ε)ια(ς):<br><strong>1.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָ֫הוּ</span> a hero of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.6\">1 Ch 12:6</a> (van d. H. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.5\">5</a>). Elsewhere -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָה</span>:<br><strong>2.</strong>  son of Rehoboam <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.19\">2 Ch 11:19</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  contemporaries of Ezra: <strong>a.</strong>  Ear <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:32\" href=\"/Ezra.10.32\">10:32</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:41\" href=\"/Ezra.10.41\">41</a>.","next":"BDB, שֹׁמְרוֹן","prev":"BDB, שִׁמֻּר"}